{"id": "Dcbbs44vQCO", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"CLI\" to get this AI Plugin to connect Claude Code to any app you use.\n\nThis free Claude Plugin tool lets you connect your Claude Code to any app or tool you use.\n\nEven the ones that don't have an official MCP or connector.\n\nCompletely free.\n\nIt's called CLI Anything.\n\nIt lets your Claude Code build a CLI for basically any software you use.\n\nIncluding the local tools already sitting on your computer.\n\nAll you do is point it at an app or repo.\n\nThen it reads its code, writes the commands, and installs it for you automatically.\n\nNo manual setup, no digging through documentation yourself.\n\nWith it, your agent can actually control things like Blender, Premiere Pro, Zoom, and even NotebookLM.\n\nDirectly from your terminal.\n\nPlus since they're all CLI, your agent now uses way fewer tokens than a stack of MCPs would.\n\nThink of it like giving Claude a universal remote instead of hunting for a different remote for every device you own.\n\nNo more waiting around for someone to build an official connector for the tool you actually need.\n\nIf it has a terminal or an API, this can probably talk to it.\n\n#claudecode #claudeai #CLI #CLIAnything #claudeplugin", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1787587041, "like_count": 3066, "comment_count": 4250, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1089509760166545a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.378, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPXnPyT5voj9-dfQNBvMGibr9xi5yDCs6J43m5SHMyex36Q6JFZH9wXB3OLnC5-Ph_2fvcM-QsgTzWgEJKXqasWTekFJvJn-8Vbbns.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdqcUa2aWASltqQSNe-dRuz4jos8TfWoe3AiZ4_MPONjgN7MlYHmXxGw8xRk17A4jMg&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=IkKZLbp0